<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sv">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= error?.status || 500 %> | Equira</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light;
        font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
        background: #f7f4ed;
        color: #33251f;
      }

      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        margin: 0;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        padding: 24px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      main {
        width: min(100%, 560px);
        padding: 48px 32px;
        text-align: center;
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #ece2cf;
        border-radius: 20px;
        box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgb(51 37 31 / 12%);
      }

      .brand {
        margin: 0 0 24px;
        color: #326a4f;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 0;
        color: #1b3b2b;
        font-size: clamp(64px, 14vw, 112px);
        line-height: 0.9;
      }

      h2 {
        margin: 24px 0 10px;
        font-size: 26px;
      }

      p {
        margin: 0 auto 28px;
        max-width: 38ch;
        color: #6f6258;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      a {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: #4a3226;
        color: #fff;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      a:hover {
        background: #38251d;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p class="">Equira</p>
      <h1><%= error?.status || 500 %></h1>
      <h2><%= message || 'Något gick fel' %></h2>
      <p>Sidan du försökte öppna kunde inte hittas.</p>
      <a href="/">Till startsidan</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
